<title>USA: Czech Industries meets SmallCap criteria.</title>
<headline>Czech Industries meets SmallCap criteria.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Industries Inc said on Tuesday Nasdaq advised the company that it complied with all requirements necessary for continued listing on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>Effective October 2, the company said in a statement its common stock would be listed under its original symbol and its Class A Warrants would trade under the original symbol &quot;CZCHW.&quot;</p>
</text>
